"in OmicsDI by accession number and source database. Returns full metadata"
" including description, protocols, instruments, organisms, tissues, "
"diseases, publication IDs, and download links. Example accessions: "
"'MTBLS1355' (MetaboLights), 'GSE12345' (GEO), 'PXD000001' (PRIDE)."
