#: ../../tools/omicsdi_tools.rst:98 d4ffc679f2d2446d8467ae774e884000
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search across multiple omics repositories integrated in "
"OmicsDI (Omics Discovery Index). Searches GEO, ArrayExpress, PRIDE, "
"MetaboLights, MetabolomicsWorkbench, PeptideAtlas, and 20+ other omics "
"repositories. Filter by omics type, organism, tissue, or date. Returns "
"dataset IDs, titles, sources, organisms, omics types, and citation "
"counts. Use omics\\_type to filter: 'Transcriptomics', 'Proteomics', "
"'Metabolomics', 'Genomics', 'Lipidomics'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/omicsdi_tools.rst:102 e17f509c56d8408b859bf8faa9d8bacc
msgid ""
